sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant UI as React web app
  participant SEC as Spring Security (JWT)
  participant API as REST controllers
  participant MS as Rule engine
  participant DB as MySQL
  actor R as Recruiter
  S->>UI: Log in
  UI->>SEC: POST /api/auth/login
  SEC-->>UI: signed token (8 h, role STUDENT)
  S->>UI: Open Career Map / Skill roadmap
  UI->>API: GET /api/student/roadmap (Bearer token)
  API->>MS: plan(levels, CGPA, open jobs)
  MS->>DB: load profile, skill levels, jobs
  MS-->>API: scores, best 1-3 step bundles
  API-->>UI: JSON shown on the map
  S->>UI: Apply to a job within reach
  UI->>API: POST /api/student/applications
  API->>DB: check résumé, consent, CGPA, then save (unique job, student)
  API-->>UI: Applied
  R->>UI: Open ranked applicants
  UI->>API: GET /api/recruiter/jobs/{id}/applicants
  API->>MS: score each applicant
  API-->>UI: ranked list with reasons
  R->>UI: Update status (e.g. Shortlisted)
  UI->>API: PATCH /api/recruiter/applications/{id}/status
  API->>DB: save status, student sees it
